title: "Hidden in Plain Code: Reliability and Limits of Frontier LLMs in Detecting Software Backdoors"
authors:
  - family-names: Capuano
    given-names: Marco
    affiliation: "OST Eastern Switzerland University of Applied Sciences"
  - family-names: Sabljak
